{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 55489, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 42102, "uid": 22757, "type": 4, "title": "预攻略-木枪raid", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1600735690, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1601465380, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 7, "status": 1, "summary": "9月29更新火勒达技能预约更新火双刃前言这期raid比较特殊，一共会有两个对策卡，不同于水比莉raid的【水蛇】，木枪raid的主要难点在boss的忍耐和ss防御。技能介绍先说说这次boss的技能。T", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600741613952_28373019.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600738866537_77086400.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600738751482_30625211.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 16289, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 55489, "content": "<div></div><div>9月29更新火勒达技能预约</div><div>更新火双刃</div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p class=\"title-p\">前言</p></div><div>这期raid比较特殊，一共会有两个对策卡，不同于水比莉raid的【水蛇】，木枪raid的主要难点在boss的忍耐和ss防御。<br></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">技能介绍</p></div><div>先说说这次boss的技能。<br></div></div><div>TS：对2名攻击力最高的角色进行2次伤害并且ss技能CD+2秒，同时给予自身10层ss防御</div><div>SS：对3名敌人造成伤害同时4名敌人侵蚀，给予自身20层ss防御</div><div>DS：自身忍耐25层</div><div>综上所述，这次的boss是完全不给ss刀活路的<br></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">输出核心（只ts）</p></div><div>第一顺位：红妲比，ts3连并且raid特定效果，给予自身过载（除ds外所有技能伤害+30%，技能冷却时间增加，技能充能速度减少）不是必须P，因为只有低加，输出还是非常高<br></div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600738751482_30625211.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600738751482_30625211.png\"></div><div>第二顺位：火伞，ts一次伤害，但是附带呐喊buff：攻击力+35.1%，最多叠加3次，持续15秒，95.8%的概率无视目标忍耐直接命</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/15/39/ChpCl14yS06EeoA2AAAAANLlkyw461.png\" alt=\"花魁巴托里\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div></div></div><div>第三顺位：火妲比，ts3连，但是完全是白板，没有任何buff</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/A1/ChpCl13wX1uEAap0AAAAAC-JGe8929.png\" alt=\"魔王妲比\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div>其余现有的火刀基本都是ss刀所以基本不作考虑</div><div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center; \"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left; \"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">辅助核心</p></div><div>先说这次raid的另一个对策，火弓，重点在ss和ds</div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600738866537_77086400.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600738866537_77086400.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">ss：给予地方2名目标1767（3980）点伤害，给予我方火属性伤害最高的2名成员16秒68.2%（110.2%）的【诸刃之剑：攻击力增加与防御力减少】与当前充能+22.7%（40.1%），raid限定：ts技能伤害+28.4%（50.6%）</div><div class=\"div-img\">ds：给予敌方3名目标4445点伤害，我方攻击力最高的3名成员20秒内充能速度+60%，raid限定：ts最终伤害+30%</div><div class=\"div-img\">火弓的ds和ss对于ts伤害的增益是非常恐怖的，现在在有技能预约的情况下基本是火弓的ds进ft。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">然后是一个相对冷门的角色：火勒达</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B3/ChpCl13zVIqEIEPpAAAAAN_tUhQ939.png\" alt=\"圣诞勒达\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600739594747_5169047.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600739594747_5169047.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">ts：增加ts刀的伤害</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">ds：在没有海王星的情况下保护队友</div><div class=\"div-img\">队长技能：增加ts的最终伤害</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">由于buff持续时间较长所以技能预约可以考虑s-t</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">经过测试，火勒达的ts和火弓ss是冲突的，火勒达技能预约更改为s</div><div class=\"div-img\">现在上火勒达的主要目的是给没有ts增伤的队伍增加ts增伤，然后s提供攻击力和ds保护队友</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">说一下喇叭的问题</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13uA9CEOJwvAAAAAFeu4KE828.png\" alt=\"小不点迪娜希\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600783766986_48532142.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600783766986_48532142.png\"></div><div>ss：造成572（3515）伤害，赋予最多5名火属性队友双刃剑（攻击力上升/防御力下降70%（115.2%），持续16秒</div><div>虽然攻击力提升巨大但是防御力会非常低（<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">据说双刃剑减防不会超过50%</span>），而且根据伤害公式应该还是“最终伤害”提升的输出大于“攻击力”</div></div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">常规辅助</p></div><div>木莫娜：2体加速（可与鲜花和嫦娥叠加）</div></div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zLZaEcirOAAAAALboDm0729.png\" alt=\"菜鸟莫娜\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div>嫦娥/鲜花：2体加速（两者不可叠加）</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1599027467205_89055324.png\" alt=\"逃亡缇丝贝\" style=\"width: 91px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13uATCEFBNjAAAAAMbt-6M451.png\" alt=\"化身的嫦娥\"><br></div><div>泡面：2体增加爆伤和暴击</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/82/ChpCl13nYY2EY18zAAAAAJ3K4fU025.png\" alt=\"流浪者的潘迪恩\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div>相机：辅助打ft</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/B6/ChpCl167kTOEH6otAAAAAPxjpCM730.png\" alt=\"炼金术师沃丹\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div>海王星：保护队友和提供双刃剑</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B2/ChpCl13zTg2EMfZ_AAAAAIybVLM278.png\" alt=\"努力派对娜普图\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">自保核心</p></div><div>新手玩家尽可能保证生存的同时蹭车拿奖励</div></div><div>花奶：持续治疗和救人，可驱散己方debuff</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/66/ChpCl16gCnGEUGNvAAAAALStrxk044.png\" alt=\"预攻略-水比莉RAID（更新装备推荐）\">&nbsp;</div><div>复活奶：全体持续治疗和救人<br></div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/95/ChpCl13txquEPVRpAAAAAAbwPa8640.png\" alt=\"预攻略-水比莉RAID（更新装备推荐）\">&nbsp;</div><div>教皇/水泡：给予护盾&nbsp;<br></div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13t-72ETMBRAAAAAEONAr8699.png\" alt=\"预攻略-水比莉RAID（更新装备推荐）\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/98/ChpCl13uCmSEF4DoAAAAANB7Ybc076.png\" alt=\"预攻略-水比莉RAID（更新装备推荐）\"><br></div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p class=\"title-p\">阵容参考</p></div><div>以下内容借鉴了B站UP手冢文轩日服天命之子的视频，<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">其中会有详细的解释，推荐raid组队前进行观看</span></div><div>https://www.bilibili.com/video/av82308841?p=1&amp;t=1476</div></div><div>红妲比+火弓队伍：火勒达和红妲比攻击力最高（<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">鲜花可替换为嫦娥</span>）（<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">勒达可替换为海王星</span>）</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;火勒达&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;红妲比（队长）&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;火弓&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 木莫娜&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;鲜花</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B3/ChpCl13zVIqEIEPpAAAAAN_tUhQ939.png\" alt=\"圣诞勒达\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600740815984_64966606.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600740815984_64966606.png\" style=\"height: 90px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600740863155_66241985.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600740863155_66241985.png\" style=\"height: 91px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zLZaEcirOAAAAALboDm0729.png\" alt=\"菜鸟莫娜\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1599027467205_89055324.png\" alt=\"逃亡缇丝贝\" style=\"width: 91px;\"></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; 技能预约t-s&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 技能预约t&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 技能预约s&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 技能预约s&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;技能预约s</div><div>ds顺序为火勒达-木莫娜-火弓（尽可能用火勒达的ds低档boss的ds伤害，ds顺序根据实战可能需要调整）</div><div><br></div><div>火伞/火妲比+火弓队：火雷达和火伞/火妲比攻击力最高（<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">鲜花可替换为嫦娥</span>）（<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-style: italic;\">勒达可替换为海王星</span>）</div><div><div>火勒达（队长）&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 火伞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 火弓&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 木莫娜&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 鲜花</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B3/ChpCl13zVIqEIEPpAAAAAN_tUhQ939.png\" alt=\"圣诞勒达\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/15/39/ChpCl14yS06EeoA2AAAAANLlkyw461.png\" alt=\"花魁巴托里\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600740863155_66241985.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600740863155_66241985.png\" style=\"height: 91px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zLZaEcirOAAAAALboDm0729.png\" alt=\"菜鸟莫娜\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1599027467205_89055324.png\" alt=\"逃亡缇丝贝\" style=\"width: 91px;\"></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; 技能预约s&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 技能预约t&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 技能预约s&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;技能预约s&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;技能预约s</div><div>ds顺序为火勒达-木莫娜-火弓（尽可能用火勒达的ds低档boss的ds伤害，ds顺序根据实战可能需要调整）</div><div><div><br></div><div>火伞/火妲比+海王星队：火雷达和火伞/火妲比攻击力最高（<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rg